sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant AuthorService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Client->>AuthorResource: GET /authors/{id}
    Note over Client,AuthorResource: Client sends GET /authors/{id}
    
    activate AuthorResource
    AuthorResource->>AuthorResource: findById(id)
    Note over AuthorResource: AuthorResource.findById(id) invoked
    
    AuthorResource->>AuthorService: findById(id)
    Note over AuthorResource,AuthorService: AuthorService.findById(id) called
    
    activate AuthorService
    AuthorService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM author WHERE id = ?
    
    activate PostgreSQL
    PostgreSQL-->>AuthorService: return author row
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    Note over AuthorService,PostgreSQL: Author object from database
    
    AuthorService-->>AuthorResource: return author
    deactivate AuthorService
    Note over AuthorService,AuthorResource: Author object returned from service
    
    AuthorResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.ok(author)
    deactivate AuthorResource
    Note over AuthorResource,Client: ResponseEntity with 200 OK returned to client